  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BIOFIN Swiss II - The Biodiversity Finance Initiative. The Biodiversity Finance Initiative develops evidence based Biodiversity Finance Plans and supports countries implement finance solutions to reach their national biodiversity targets. It promotes national platforms, regional and global dialogues enabling countries to accelerate the reduction of their finance needs to the point where these biodiversity targets are no longer hampered by the systemic lack of investment</narrative>
